settle
shot main-menu-identity
key up
wait-for-change 30 1
key up
wait-for-change 30 1
key up
wait-for-change 30 1
key x
wait-for-change 30 1
settle
shot system-settings
key x
wait-for-change 30 1
settle
shot information
